--- !u!114 &1305387154908032388
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3121083627102528482}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c5236d538fb060b48834286d70f34fa6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Pilar.Context::Pilar.Context.ContextNode
  _entries:
  - key: Function
    value: Index lift cylinder. Raises the pallet off the conveyor to a repeatable
      position and fixes the payload while the station works on it.
  - key: Signal
    value: Double solenoid with both limits read. EXTENDED raises the carriage and
      fixes the pallet clear of the belt; retracted is home.
  - key: Caution
    value: The station must be blocking before this raises, and the operation must
      be complete before it lowers. Those are two of the three Index invariants.
  _topologySegment: 
  _topologyParent: {fileID: 0}
