      value: Signal
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6516866756859488269, guid: 84515f9fd16e55d43b20c5409104842c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[2].key
      value: Approximation
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6516866756859488269, guid: 84515f9fd16e55d43b20c5409104842c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[0].value
      value: Stopper cylinder. Retracted holds an incoming pallet at the station;
        extending releases it once the next station is free.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6516866756859488269, guid: 84515f9fd16e55d43b20c5409104842c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[1].value
      value: Double solenoid with both limits read. RETRACTED (min) holds the pallet;
        EXTENDING (max) releases it - the blade drops out of the way.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6516866756859488269, guid: 84515f9fd16e55d43b20c5409104842c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[2].value
      value: Instant, frictionless travel bounded only by the axis. There is no air
        pressure, no seal wear and nothing that could make a stroke slow rather than
        fail.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7312011994908183973, guid: 84515f9fd16e55d43b20c5409104842c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalPosition.x
