      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[0].value
      value: Exit sensor just past the stopper. Confirms the released pallet has
        actually left before the unit returns to idle.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1307102641081823463, guid: b1ed7a465bf8e1148b8ad865924f49b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[1].value
      value: Binary presence sensor at the station exit. Its RISING EDGE is what
        clears the transfer latch, in every PackML state.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1307102641081823463, guid: b1ed7a465bf8e1148b8ad865924f49b6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[2].value
      value: 'Read the edge, never the level: B_Exit may still be made by the PREVIOUS
        pallet when the next release commits.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
